# The Apple SDK is resolved per build by
# third_party/fvp/darwin/fvp/tool/mdk_apple_freshness.py, because libmdk stops
# playing video 44 days after its own build stamp. CI rejects committed native
# binaries, and a committed copy would be the pin this replaced.
